#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "498368"
msgid "\n―――#[Hold up][Errrr]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "498396"
msgid "What is he, streaking…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "498528"
msgid "But, well, I won't complain now. I lost 90% of\nmy belongings in coming to this side. I'll\nresign myself to abject poverty for a spell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499048"
msgid "Those events are but a dream now,\nbut the battles you waged were real.\nAnd so I'm here now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499200"
msgid "I thought #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF wasn't able to come over to this side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499340"
msgid "I also looked into the Servant you were with\non this side. Its class was a #C000246204Berserker#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499776"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF speaks matter-of-factly.\nI take in his arrogance with both shock and acquaintance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500188"
msgid "I take his outstretched hand.\nLeaving one #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF, I use two."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500700"
msgid "――――Yeah.\nI can't be standing around here."
msgstr ""

