#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "509504"
msgid "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "509560"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "509644"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "509724"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "509792"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "509832"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "509864"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "509896"
msgid "Hmph. I arrived ahead of you to find this room\nlacking as well. Truly, this layout reeks of\nyour modesty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510004"
msgid "―――I remember. I remember now―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510044"
msgid "This is the extraordinary Servant that I contracted\nover in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF―#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510176"
msgid "Right, we took care of the disaster #C236196003BB#CDEF\nbrought about in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510292"
msgid "Good. Your memory is in order. You're not like\nthe other Masters. You managed to contract me,\noriginally a dweller of the #C000246204Far Side#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510440"
msgid "I―――I don't really understand, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510484"
msgid "I broke that rule. Since I was awake,\nI figured I would seek some amusement\nas I took my legs for a stretch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510596"
msgid "Once they had lost sight of you,\nthey didn't hesitate to sever your contract.\nYou were abandoned by your own pet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510712"
msgid "Even I didn't anticipate that. It would've\ndisgraced me if you had been expelled due to the\nlack of a Servant rather than elimination."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510848"
msgid "You're someone I contracted with―jest or not.\nYour end must come after expending your all in\na battle ultimately beyond your ability."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510984"
msgid "Welling up within is me a feeling of wonder, and something else.\nI don't really know why, but I can't help but grin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511104"
msgid "So, what will you do?\nThere's a Servant here.\nAnd he's not particularly preoccupied."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511192"
msgid "If you seek to rise to the top with me,\nthen take my hand. THIS time, it's your rightful\nmoment to invoke those #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511336"
msgid "First: we will be as equals.\nI swear on this #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF\nthat we will be free to believe in one another,\nrespect one another, and if need be, confront one another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511520"
msgid "With this next seal―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511548"
msgid "―――Is that so? A fine oath, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nWith this, you've proven yourself\nworthy of unleashing my blades for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511676"
msgid "Let's go, Master. We head for the #C000246204Moon Cell's\nCore#CDEF, the seat of Heaven's devoted. Let the\nexpected become the unexpected with me here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511828"
msgid "I look at the petal in my hand one more time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511876"
msgid "…it's all just a dream now,\nbut I know for sure that there was once a girl:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511956"
msgid "A girl who defied the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF to protect something.\nI'll probably find out what her wish was once I advance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512084"
msgid "My battles continue.\nAnd ever they will until I reach the Moon Cell's Core,\nwaiting at the end of the seven seas――"
msgstr ""

